{"id":"vod_bf_43717","vodId":"43717","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"元气少女缘结神第一季","name_cn":"元气少女缘结神第一季","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/15b55672f1cdad0d5463480247304879.jpg"},"summary":"由于父亲欠下了一屁股债人间蒸发，无家可归的女儿桃园奈奈生（三森铃子 配音）只得流浪街头。在这途中，奈奈生帮助了一位被恶狗追逐的男子，男子告诉奈奈生自己名叫御影（石田彰 配音），而在得知了奈奈生的遭遇后，他意外的提出将自己的住处让给奈奈生。一间荒芜的神社——这便是御影所说 的住处，奈奈生自觉上当，却也没有别的地方好去。更令她吃惊的是，御影竟然是神社的土地神，而如今，土地神的头衔，自然也随着住处转嫁到了奈奈生的头上。　　莫名其妙的成为了土地神，而身边又出现了称她为“主人”的神使巴卫（立花慎之介 配音），奈奈生还未搞清楚状况，各路个性可爱又调皮的神灵就接二连三的降临到了她的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:10:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanjieshendiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuanqishaonvyuanj